            <description><![CDATA[환경 설정]]></description>
            <content:encoded><![CDATA[<h2 class="anchor anchorTargetStickyNavbar_Vzrq" id="환경-설정">환경 설정<a href="https://kyungpyokim.github.io/lab/blog/2026/02/09/lecture-01#%ED%99%98%EA%B2%BD-%EC%84%A4%EC%A0%95" class="hash-link" aria-label="Direct link to 환경 설정" title="Direct link to 환경 설정" translate="no">​</a></h2>
<ol>
<li class="">
<p>Visual Studio Code 설치</p>
<ol>
<li class="">extension 설치<!-- -->
<ol>
<li class="">Python</li>
<li class="">Jupyter</li>
<li class="">Ruff (optional)</li>
<li class="">indent-rainbow (optional)</li>
<li class="">Git Graph (optional)</li>
</ol>
</li>
</ol>
</li>
<li class="">
<p>uv 설치</p>
<ol>
<li class="">windows<!-- -->
<div class="language-text codeBlockContainer_Ckt0 theme-code-block" style="--prism-color:#393A34;--prism-background-color:#f6f8fa"><div class="codeBlockContent_QJqH"><pre tabindex="0" class="prism-code language-text codeBlock_bY9V thin-scrollbar" style="color:#393A34;background-color:#f6f8fa"><code class="codeBlockLines_e6Vv"><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">powershell -ExecutionPolicy ByPass -c "irm https://astral.sh/uv/install.ps1 | iex"</span><br></span></code></pre></div></div>
</li>
</ol>
</li>
<li class="">
<p>파이썬 / 쥬피터 노트북 설치</p>
</li>
<li class="">
<p>uv 환경 설정</p>
<ol>
<li class="">uv 설정<!-- -->
<div class="language-text codeBlockContainer_Ckt0 theme-code-block" style="--prism-color:#393A34;--prism-background-color:#f6f8fa"><div class="codeBlockContent_QJqH"><pre tabindex="0" class="prism-code language-text codeBlock_bY9V thin-scrollbar" style="color:#393A34;background-color:#f6f8fa"><code class="codeBlockLines_e6Vv"><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">uv init</span><br></span></code></pre></div></div>
</li>
<li class="">Python 버전 설정 (최신 버전 보다는 3.11 or 3.12 추천)</li>
<li class="">.python-version과 pyproject.toml안의 Python 버전을 3.11 or 3.12 수정.</li>
<li class="">가상환경 생성<!-- -->
<div class="language-text codeBlockContainer_Ckt0 theme-code-block" style="--prism-color:#393A34;--prism-background-color:#f6f8fa"><div class="codeBlockContent_QJqH"><pre tabindex="0" class="prism-code language-text codeBlock_bY9V thin-scrollbar" style="color:#393A34;background-color:#f6f8fa"><code class="codeBlockLines_e6Vv"><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">uv venv</span><br></span></code></pre></div></div>
</li>
<li class="">가상환경 활성화<!-- -->
<div class="language-text codeBlockContainer_Ckt0 theme-code-block" style="--prism-color:#393A34;--prism-background-color:#f6f8fa"><div class="codeBlockContent_QJqH"><pre tabindex="0" class="prism-code language-text codeBlock_bY9V thin-scrollbar" style="color:#393A34;background-color:#f6f8fa"><code class="codeBlockLines_e6Vv"><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">.venv\Scripts\activate</span><br></span></code></pre></div></div>
</li>
</ol>
</li>
<li class="">
<p>jupyter 라이브러리 추가</p>
<div class="language-text codeBlockContainer_Ckt0 theme-code-block" style="--prism-color:#393A34;--prism-background-color:#f6f8fa"><div class="codeBlockContent_QJqH"><pre tabindex="0" class="prism-code language-text codeBlock_bY9V thin-scrollbar" style="color:#393A34;background-color:#f6f8fa"><code class="codeBlockLines_e6Vv"><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">uv add jupyter</span><br></span></code></pre></div></div>
<p>팁) jupyter를 설치하면 ipykernel이 자동 설치된다. 따로 설치할 필요 없음.</p>
</li>
<li class="">
<p>TroublesShooting</p>
<ol>
<li class="">uv kernel을 못찾는 경우.<!-- -->
<ul>
<li class="">해결책1 : vscode 재시작</li>
<li class="">해결책2 :  *.ipynb 파일 선택후 Select Kernel 선택후 ./venv/bin/python를 선택</li>
<li class="">해결책3 : uv를 다시 설치</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li class="">윈도우 보완 문제로 uv가 설치한 python을 실행 못하는 에러<!-- -->
<ul>
<li class="">임시 해결책 : python이 설치되는 폴더를 보안 제외 대상으로 설정.</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ol>
</li>
</ol>]]></content:encoded>
